            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0182/ch0182_tactic_defeat_2",
            "LocalizeJP": "すまない。…もっと情熱を燃やしていれば。",
            "LocalizeEN": "I'm sorry, if only I had more passion"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10051,
            "DialogCategory": "Tactic",
            "VoiceClip": "Utaha_(Cheerleader)_Tactic_In_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0182/ch0182_tactic_in_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "If you want support, leave it to me."
        },
        {
